te.** They are cut at file opens, so \"layout\" also includes opening the document in JavaScript and setting up fonts. Tracing adds 10–20%, and probably not evenly across phases. The split shows proportions, not exact costs per phase.\n3. **The measurement script isn't meant to be rerun as-is.** It modifies nothing in the package. But it hard-codes the install path, ignores the 3-run median, and its sample files are in `/tmp/eo-samples`, which is not in the repository.\n\nVERDICT: APPROVE Phases measured and the dominant part identified; baseline.md is out of target and correctly sent to a follow-up request","ttft_ms":2160,"type":"result","duration_ms":18192,"uuid":"1281ef0b-a5cf-4b89-b2bc-3db135d14bd6","ttft_stream_ms":968,"time_to_request_ms":352,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":5,"system_prompt":219,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":4,"input_attachments":21,"input_hooks":3,"conversation_append":0,"transcript_persist":22,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":6,"init_frame_send":3,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":3,"message_prep":1,"model_config_wait":0,"autocompact":2,"request_announcements":10,"query_setup":3,"auto_mode_context_wait":8,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":21,"message_normalization":2,"client_creation":5,"request_build":13},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":37,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":176,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":215,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":140,"process_rss_mib_result":228,"process_anon_mib_result":139,"process_peak_rss_mib":256,"process_cpu_ms_turn":1090,"process_wall_ms_turn":18191,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":492,"process_wall_ms_streaming":14939,"main_stream_count":5,"main_stream_event_count":273,"main_stream_chunk_count":98,"input_attachments_detail":{"slowest_producer":"artifact_opening_prefetch","slowest_producer_ms":7,"cpu_ms":21,"major_faults":0,"setup_ms":0,"prompt_producers_ms":0,"ambient_start_ms":10,"ambient_wait_ms":6,"render_ms":2,"produc